						<vx-text block size="sm" text="sm · 13 / 20，辅助说明与注释" />
						<view class="demo-tx-gap">
							<vx-text block size="md" text="md · 15 / 22，正文默认档位" />
						</view>
						<view class="demo-tx-gap">
							<vx-text block size="lg" text="lg · 17 / 24，短标题与强调" />
						</view>
						<view class="demo-tx-divider"></view>
						<vx-text block weight="regular" text="regular 400 · 正文" />
						<view class="demo-tx-gap">
							<vx-text block weight="medium" text="medium 500 · 表单值" />
						</view>
						<view class="demo-tx-gap">
							<vx-text block weight="semibold" text="semibold 600 · 小标题" />
						</view>
						<view class="demo-tx-gap">
							<vx-text block weight="bold" text="bold 700 · 金额" />
						</view>
					</view>
					<text class="demo-hint">size 是正文档位，不借控件字号；页面级 28 / 34 的展示标题仍用页面自己的 text。</text>
				</view>

				<view class="demo-section">
					<demo-section-head title="自定义颜色" desc="color 是字面值，优先于 type；禁用时两者都不生效。" />
					<view class="demo-tx-stage">
						<vx-text block color="#8a2b33" text="品牌红 · #8a2b33" />
						<view class="demo-tx-gap">
							<vx-text block color="#2f6f4f" text="品牌绿 · #2f6f4f" />
						</view>
						<view class="demo-tx-gap">
							<vx-text block type="secondary" color="var(--vx-color-primary-pressed)" text="传令牌 · var(--vx-color-primary-pressed)" />
						</view>
						<view class="demo-tx-gap">
							<vx-text block type="danger" color="#7a5b13" text="color 盖过 type · #7a5b13" />
						</view>
					</view>
					<text class="demo-hint">字面值不跟随主题，亮暗两套对比度由业务保证；要跟主题就传 var(--vx-color-*)。</text>
				</view>

				<view class="demo-section">
					<demo-section-head title="对齐与装饰" desc="align 在 block 或确定宽度下生效；decoration 只有下划线和删除线。" />
					<view class="demo-tx-stage">
						<vx-text block align="left" text="左对齐 · 默认" />
						<view class="demo-tx-gap">
							<vx-text block align="center" text="居中对齐 · center" />
						</view>
						<view class="demo-tx-gap">
							<vx-text block align="right" text="右对齐 · right" />
						</view>
						<view class="demo-tx-divider"></view>
						<vx-text block decoration="underline" text="下划线 · underline" />
						<view class="demo-tx-gap">
							<vx-text block decoration="line-through" text="删除线 · line-through" />
						</view>
						<view class="demo-tx-gap">
							<vx-text block size="lg" weight="semibold" text="两档组合：价格 ￥199" decoration="underline" />
						</view>
					</view>
					<text class="demo-hint">同一段文字只加一种装饰线；下划线和删除线都不改字重。</text>
				</view>

				<view class="demo-section">
					<demo-section-head title="截断" desc="maxLines 0 不限、1 单行省略、2 以上多行截断。" />
					<view class="demo-tx-stage">
						<text class="demo-tx-label">maxLines=1</text>
						<vx-text block :max-lines="1"
							text="这段文字只显示一行，超出部分省略号收尾；click 和 copy 拿到的是完整文本，不是屏幕上这一段。" />
						<view class="demo-tx-gap">
							<text class="demo-tx-label">maxLines=2</text>
							<vx-text block :max-lines="2"
								text="这段文字最多显示两行，第三行开始省略；用于卡片摘要、商品标题和列表里的多行说明。" />
						</view>
						<view class="demo-tx-gap">
							<text class="demo-tx-label">maxLines=0 · 不限</text>
							<vx-text block
								text="不限行数时按内容自然换行，整段都显示出来；长正文用这一档，不要再套一层 scroll-view。" />
						</view>
					</view>
					<text class="demo-hint">截断只影响显示；多行截断在 App 5.21+、Web 和微信小程序可用。</text>
				</view>

				<view class="demo-section">
					<demo-section-head title="格式化" desc="phone、amount、bank-card、id-card 四种；先格式化再显示。" />
					<view class="demo-tx-stage">
						<view class="demo-tx-row">
							<text class="demo-tx-label">phone</text>
							<vx-text format="phone" text="15123452222" />
						</view>
						<view class="demo-tx-row">
							<text class="demo-tx-label">amount</text>
							<vx-text format="amount" text="5201314" />
						</view>
						<view class="demo-tx-row">
							<text class="demo-tx-label">amount · 0 位</text>
							<vx-text format="amount" :decimals="0" text="1280" />
						</view>
						<view class="demo-tx-row">
							<text class="demo-tx-label">amount · 前缀</text>
							<vx-text format="amount" currency="$" text="1280" />
						</view>
						<view class="demo-tx-row">
							<text class="demo-tx-label">bank-card</text>
							<vx-text format="bank-card" text="6222021234567890" />
						</view>
						<view class="demo-tx-row">
							<text class="demo-tx-label">id-card</text>
							<vx-text format="id-card" text="440300199001011234" />
						</view>
					</view>
					<text class="demo-hint">phone 只处理 1 开头的 11 位；带标签的整串原样返回，所以标签要放在外层 text 里。</text>
				</view>

				<view class="demo-section">
					<demo-section-head title="复制与选中" desc="长按复制抛 copy；可选中的走系统菜单，两者只选一个。" />
					<view class="demo-tx-stage">
						<vx-text copyable text="长按这段文字可以复制订单号 VX202611010001" @copy="onCopy" />
						<view class="demo-tx-gap">
							<vx-text selectable text="这段文字可选中：在 App 上长按弹系统菜单，Web 上可以直接划选。" />
						</view>
						<view class="demo-tx-gap">
							<vx-text clickable text="这段文字可点击，点击会回传完整文本" @click="onTextClick" />
						</view>
						<view class="demo-tx-divider"></view>
						<text class="demo-tx-status">最近一次：{{ lastAction }}</text>
					</view>
					<text class="demo-hint">copyable 按下同样压到 0.8，长按才复制；Web 桌面端没有长按，要另给可见的复制按钮。</text>
				</view>

				<view class="demo-section">
					<demo-section-head title="状态与组合" desc="禁用同时关掉点击、复制和选择；下面是一张用文本拼成的订单卡。" />
					<view class="demo-tx-stage">
						<vx-text block disabled text="已停用：不响应点击和复制，文字转 disabled-text" />
						<view class="demo-tx-divider"></view>
						<view class="demo-tx-card">
							<view class="demo-tx-card__row">
								<text class="demo-tx-card__label">订单号</text>
								<vx-text size="sm" text="VX202611010001" />
							</view>
							<view class="demo-tx-card__row">
								<text class="demo-tx-card__label">商品</text>
								<vx-text size="sm" :max-lines="1" text="明前龙井 250g · 礼盒装" />
							</view>
							<view class="demo-tx-card__row">
								<text class="demo-tx-card__label">合计</text>
								<vx-text weight="semibold" format="amount" text="26800" />
							</view>
							<view class="demo-tx-card__row">
								<text class="demo-tx-card__label">状态</text>
								<vx-text type="warning" size="sm" text="待发货" />
							</view>
						</view>
					</view>
					<text class="demo-hint">禁用只灰化组件渲染的文案；插槽里的内容要自己处理禁用态。</text>
